  "title": "Northern Stuffed Burgers",
  "description": "These burgers are first mixed with some spices for flavor, then you stuff them with your favorite condiments. We use any or all of the following: mustard, ketchup, chili sauce, relish, chopped dill pickles and grated cheese.",
